# m h dom mon dow command
# Nightly at 03:10 UTC — after the fleet's other backups (02:00-02:30) so they don't
# compete for the same disk and network. Absolute path and an explicit TLS cap:
# crond does not inherit the image's PATH, and the database closes TLS 1.3
# handshakes from this network.
10 3 * * * /usr/local/bin/node --tls-max-v1.2 /app/index.js
